{"id":"vod_lz_145126","vodId":"145126","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"天是红河岸","name_cn":"天是红河岸","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第16集","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20260708-1/ce004ecd1e84369a4963fe9159e28154.webp"},"summary":"日本国中女生铃木夕梨被咒术牵引至纪元前的赫梯帝国，并长期遭受娜姬雅王后的追杀，目的在于以她为祭品咒杀凯鲁王子。在凯鲁的庇护与指导下，夕梨从误打误撞开始学习成长，到最后能够与王太后在政治舞台上一较高下，其强大的行动力以及敏锐卓越的决策能力，被凯鲁和部下认定为唯一的王后人选。历经凯鲁登基为王、放弃回日本、多次被掳、流产以及政治斗争之后，娜姬雅终于自王宫中被排除，由夕梨登上后位继承达瓦安娜的名号，与凯鲁两人共同创造盛世。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-10-21 10:55:34","playable":true,"episodeCount":16,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260708/8122_4de2e849/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260715/8449_011be519/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260722/8802_b870e653/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260729/9060_4ffdc2f1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260805/9407_160a5aa3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260812/9724_2d40c05e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260819/10056_d4124dbd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260826/10538_d6078fcf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260902/10872_22745b95/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260909/11169_fab357bf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260916/11503_6e88e39a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260923/11833_312c0e13/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260930/12131_9e02cde9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20261008/12472_b4e99092/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20261014/12685_31f21e89/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20261021/13292_c47f06